{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_03_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "66ef7d91be8ff9d83b95774abfa1a5d6b066754082a56fb6bd2e5f4179e6e078", "ja": "あれ？　茜、なんか落としたよ？\n『巨大茜ちゃんチョコ・設計図』……これ作るんだ。", "zh": "咦？茜，你好像掉了什么东西哦？  \n《巨大小茜巧克力·设计图》……要做这个啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0220_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0220_story_03_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "fb4191f981f527d8d09bf1703206593eb32f7ca7c51b1c50151d5094fd8c0004", "ja": "わあ、中ボスくらいの大きさだね！\nでもこれ、お客さんに配る時はどうするのかな？", "zh": "哇，有小Boss那么大呢！\n不过这个，发给观众的时候要怎么办呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
